{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Dinner</strong> is a <strong>short psychological</strong> horror game that explores the unraveling mind of Erick \u2014 a war veteran haunted by guilt and disturbing memories as he tries to live a normal life with his family.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though Erick believes he's getting better, his hallucinations say otherwise. He clings to routine, but something sinister lingers beneath the surface. A single day at home becomes a descent into a mind that refuses to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>...until the worst happens.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Day That Won\u2019t End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform ordinary household tasks while the environment subtly turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/NEW_GIF_01.gif?t=1751415812\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take medication or play music to ease hallucinations and stabilize your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/NEW_GIF_03.gif?t=1751415812\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Psychological Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a tragic past through environmental clues, inner monologues, and playable flashbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/NEW_GIF_04.gif?t=1751415812\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visceral Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Erick\u2019s most repressed moments \u2014 moments that twist the familiar into something terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/NEW_GIF_05.gif?t=1751415812\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Traumatic Ending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erick's trauma manifests itself in his actions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537410?t=1751415812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537410?t=1751415812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/03486bc81b0fea60c6622d07c7f9b2eb51bd7cf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751415812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/03486bc81b0fea60c6622d07c7f9b2eb51bd7cf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751415812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror themes, including hallucinations, stroboscopic effects, unsettling imagery, and scenes of gore."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3661370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Dinner</strong> is a <strong>short psychological</strong> horror game that explores the unraveling mind of Erick \u2014 a war veteran haunted by guilt and disturbing memories as he tries to live a normal life with his family.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though Erick believes he's getting better, his hallucinations say otherwise. He clings to routine, but something sinister lingers beneath the surface. A single day at home becomes a descen